WEBVTT
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
So — how great Karanja's importance is.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.780
And this heritage — five hundred, five hundred and fifty years old — keeping it safe the way it is today…

3
00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:14.460
and with time, it does break apart.

4
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.400
So, to carry it further forward,

5
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.540
this team is at it, without a break.

6
00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:24.580
What you're seeing now, like this — it isn't like this.

7
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:31.400
When the work is going on here, that is worth seeing —

8
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:35.460
how they handle each single leaf […],

9
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:40.600
how they work on it. […] the ink has thinned,

10
00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:46.740
so they make up a proper solution for it…

11
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:51.320
every single process is done in such a controlled way,

12
00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:56.900
because done any other way, it would come apart and be ruined.

13
00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:00.920
And once a grantha has passed through here,

14
00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:05.660
its life grows by another 100–150 years,

15
00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:09.000
because it is laminated — and you won't even see

16
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.020
that it has been laminated.

17
00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:15.000
And the biggest thing: this whole process is reversible.

18
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.020
Nowhere is any chemical used

19
00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:23.560
that would damage it, or […] ruin it.

20
00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:26.540
If you want to take it back to the original,

21
00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:29.180
you can reverse it completely.

22
00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:31.620
That is the kind of work done here.

23
00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:34.640
Honestly — however much I say, it falls short.

24
00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:46.200
How much time you give to every single thing says it all — there is pride in it, and involvement.
